  "title": "· IN-BAG | Miu Miu Debuts New Small Leather Goods and Bag Charms: the Trick Foldable Pouch and Wool Charms ·",
  "original_title": "IN-BAG | Miu Miu 上市新款小皮具和包包挂饰：Trick 可折叠小包，羊毛挂件",
  "excerpt": "Miu Miu launches new small leather goods and charms, including the versatile Trick drawstring bag and playful beaded bear, lemon, and flower charms.",
  "author": "撰稿 X LING 编辑 X VIVI",
