    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Miu Miu has just launched a new collection of small leather goods and bag charms. The new Trick drawstring bag is full of clever design touches—it can be worn as a backpack when unfurled, or folded up via the top flap for easy storage and carrying, adding a playful element. The bag charms feature beadwork and weaving techniques to create adorable shapes like bears, straw hats, lemons, and flowers, showcasing exquisite craftsmanship.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/4vg0q60/f3d153d5126f9728.jpg",
