      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Trick Foldable Nylon Bag ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Trick bag is made from lightweight, portable nylon in a drawstring silhouette, accented with a small lambskin flap. Its standout feature is its versatile shape—when unfurled, it serves as a large drawstring pouch with nylon cord straps that can be worn as a backpack; it can also be cinched via the top flap buckle and easily folded into a mini size, making it easy to store and carry as a bag-in-bag.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
